## Interface: 16001
## Title: BagValue
## Notes: A standalone window that totals the player's carried money, the vendor value of every item in all bags, and the auction value of those items using a configurable price source (TSM, Auctionator, Auctinator, Auctioneer, AHDB, Wowecon, or a custom function).
## Author: BagValue contributors
## Version: 0.2.0
## SavedVariables: BAGVALUE_DB
